[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3795334317","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115332#issuecomment-3795334317","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115332","id":3795334317,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iODSt","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-24T18:46:27Z","updated_at":"2026-01-24T18:46:42Z","body":"`_init()` runs after properties are initialized and it can't be used to set a default. The default value in your case is empty array.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3795334317/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3804535802","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115332#issuecomment-3804535802","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115332","id":3804535802,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ixJv6","user":{"login":"rpanda0421","id":169220389,"node_id":"U_kgDOChYZJQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169220389?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpanda0421","html_url":"https://github.com/rpanda0421","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpanda0421/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpanda0421/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpanda0421/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpanda0421/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpanda0421/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpanda0421/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpanda0421/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpanda0421/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rpanda0421/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T11:06:23Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T11:06:23Z","body":"I think I’ve mostly understood what’s going on.\n\nWhen ResourceSaver saves a Resource, if an exported (or `@export_storage`) property’s value is equal to its default value, it is not written into the .tres file. As a result, after deserialization, the resulting value of those properties is determined by the `_init` method, which can differ from the value at save time. If the value differs from the default, it is serialized correctly.\n\nI also tested `var_to_bytes_with_objects` and `bytes_to_var_with_objects`, and this issue does not occur there. \n\nIs this a design choice? It does, however, cause confusion in practice.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3804535802/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3805472197","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115332#issuecomment-3805472197","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115332","id":3805472197,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7i0uXF","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T14:16:55Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T14:16:55Z","body":"Scenes and Resources don't save default values, because it's not necessary and also makes the files smaller. When a scene/resource is loaded, it has all necessary information about its type, which allows to automatically assign defaults. The format allows that.\n\n`var_to_bytes()` and related methods just save things as is. I suppose it should be documented.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3805472197/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]